==Trivia==
* A heka, also known as a {{WP|Crook and flail|crook}}, is a hooked sceptre associated with the god {{WP|Osiris}} and was a symbol of rule in Ancient Egypt.
* During the [[Unrestricted world#Tombs of Amascut: Rewards Beta|ToA Weapons Beta]] and [[Unrestricted world#Nex Rewards Beta|Nex Weapons Beta]] in which Tumeken's heka could be playtested, the heka's fast attack had an additional max hit of 1. In addition, the fast attacks only used 50% of the player's [[magic damage]] bonus from equipped items when calculating damage, whilst the charged attack used 150%. These were removed when the heka was reworked in the {{UD|Tombs of Amascut: Raid Rewards V2}} poll blog.

